{"id": "EUVD-2026-41504", "enisaUuid": "6bf36cac-49da-3149-8bae-8ecd46bb2292", "description": "libcurl might in some circumstances reuse the wrong connection when asked to\ndo Negotiate-authenticated ones, even when they are set to use different\n\"services\".\n\nlibcurl features a pool of recent connections so that subsequent requests can\nreuse an existing connection to avoid overhead.\n\nWhen reusing a connection a range of criteria must be met. Due to a logical\nerror in the code, a request that was issued by an application could\nwrongfully reuse an existing connection to the same server that was\nauthenticated using different services.", "datePublished": "2026-07-03T06:14:42", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-15T06:03:19", "baseScore": 6.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:H/A:N", "references": ["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2026-8458.json", "https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2026-8458.html", "https://hackerone.com/reports/3721183"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-8458", "GHSA-88c6-6jfq-mm4q"], "assigner": "curl", "epss": 0.37, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0422c919-82cd-3eb1-9b4b-6eea33c1a608", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "7.79.0"}, {"id": "055d1a33-c253-3874-85cd-3715a304627f", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "7.80.0"}, {"id": "060e6ab0-afcc-30c6-b0e5-93151d552f04", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.9.0"}, {"id": "06ddc5b8-831c-3120-abb9-edd9fae23210", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "7.68.0"}, {"id": "0f752ab7-8707-3edc-9fb9-2fb98a1f3ccd", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "7.67.0"}, {"id": "1467d36b-551b-3b41-bb88-43c4e9f48e26", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "7.61.0"}, {"id": "187a01d7-fc00-33f8-a5a2-7c0691cd07a8", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "p